      "op": "note",
      "text": "开屏并保持（790 既是探针武装带哨兵也是本场景 gate）。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop openkeep O",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
      "ms": 1100
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "兜底：开屏后由服务端注入装上经商立牌（开屏瞬间装会触发「进店 +1 星币」把 790 抬成 791，gate 失配）。item 参数是 Brigadier StringArgumentType.string()，必须带引号。"
    },
    {
      "op": "inject_command",
      "command": "/astralshop equip O stand \"astral_dice:parunan_sign\"",
      "no_esc": true
    },
    {
      "op": "wait",
